{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"一、六年，春王三月，王人子突救衞。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"王人者何？微者也。子突者何？貴也。貴則其稱人何？繫諸人也。曷為繫諸人？王人耳。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"二、夏六月，衞侯朔入于衞。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"衞侯朔何以名？絕。曷為絕之？犯命也。其言入何？篡辭也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"三、秋，公至自伐衞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"曷為或言致會？或言致伐？得意致會，不得意致伐。衞侯朔入于衞，何以致伐？不敢勝天子也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"四、螟。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"五、冬，齊人來歸衞寶。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_35_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_35","textTraditional":"此衞寶也，則齊人曷為來歸之？衞人歸之也。衞人歸之，則其稱齊人何？讓乎我也。其讓乎我奈何？齊侯曰：「此非寡人之力，魯侯之力也。」","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}